* ============================================================
* gm/Id Characterization -- PMOS |Vsg| sweep at fixed |Vsd|
* W = {w_um} um   L = {l_um} um   |Vsd| = fixed
* Vg sweep: {vg_start} -> {vg_stop} V  step {vg_step} V
* Python computes |Vsg| = VDD - Vg
* ============================================================

.include {model_path}

* VDD rail (PMOS source and bulk)
VDD  vdd   0   DC {vdd_v}

* Gate: absolute DC level, swept from VDD down to 0
Vgate gate  0   DC {vdd_v}

* Drain: VD = VDD - |Vsd_fixed|  (fixed during sweep)
Vdrain drain 0  DC {vd_v}

* PMOS DUT:  D=drain  G=gate  S=vdd  B=vdd
M1 drain gate vdd vdd {model} W={w_um}u L={l_um}u

.options reltol=1e-6 vntol=1e-9 abstol=1e-12
.temp 27

.control
  dc Vgate {vg_start} {vg_stop} {vg_step}
  wrdata {dat_path} v(gate) i(Vdrain)
  quit
.endc

.end
